# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan Revision Update Improvements<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
<br>
As a fashion designer and advocate for sustainability, I have been working on a research plan to improve the environmental impact of our designs. Based on Robert&#x27;s feedback, I have revised the plan to include more specific goals and objectives.<br>
<br>
## Goals and Objectives<br>
<br>
* Reduce waste in production by 20% within the next 6 months<br>
* Increase use of eco-friendly materials by 30% within the next year<br>
* Implement a recycling program for fabric scraps and packaging materials<br>
<br>
## Methods<br>
<br>
* Conduct a thorough analysis of our current supply chain to identify areas for improvement<br>
* Collaborate with suppliers to implement more sustainable practices<br>
* Develop a plan for reducing energy consumption in our workshop<br>
<br>
## Expected Outcomes<br>
<br>
* Reduced waste and environmental impact<br>
* Increased use of eco-friendly materials<br>
* Improved reputation and customer loyalty<br>
<br>
## Timeline<br>
<br>
* Month 1-3: Conduct supply chain analysis and develop plan for implementation<br>
* Month 4-6: Implement recycling program and reduce energy consumption<br>
* Month 7-12: Monitor progress and make adjustments as needed<br>
